					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mongoose Tassea&lt;/color&gt;, chief of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Cambocho People&lt;/color&gt; is requesting a favor. His friend &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Coyote Dorna&lt;/color&gt; is interested in learning about other cultures, and he wants you to host her at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;22 days&lt;/color&gt;. 

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Coyote&lt;/color&gt; will not do any work.</description>
					<root>Hospitality_Joiners</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
