				<li>
					<id>9</id>
					<name>Dreadful Monument</name>
					<appearanceTick>2424000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>0</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>2607353</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>Baron &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Philippis Zeroros&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to insult the nose of his rival.

The monument is 8 x 13 in size and will require these resources (total value $531):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x390
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x200
    - Granite blocks x200
    - Limestone blocks x200
    - Slate blocks x200
    - Marble blocks x200

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;79 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the baron's enforcement system will activate and a mech cluster will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt; containing:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 count-down activator&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 proximity activator&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 unstable power cell&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 gloomlight&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 auto charge turrets&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 mini-slugger turrets&lt;/color&gt;

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
					<root>BuildMonument_TimeProtect</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>10</id>
					<name>Lynx's Acolyte Ceremony</name>
					<appearanceTick>2469253</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>2469896</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>599356</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>2477942</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; is ready to grant &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lynx&lt;/color&gt; the title of acolyte and the power of a level 2 psylink in a bestowing ceremony.

The bestower will arrive by shuttle and perform the ceremony.

The bestower will only give a title if any throneroom requirements are satisfied.

You can betray the bestower to steal psylink neuroformers, but this will make &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; your enemy.

If you miss or fail this ceremony, there will be another opportunity later. If the bestower or guards are harmed for any reason, there will be diplomatic consequences.</description>
					<root>BestowingCeremony</root>
